//StackOverflow

//FR

1. User should be able to search questions.
2. User should be able to view a question and its answers.
3. User should be able to post a question.
4. User should be able to post an answer to a question.
5. User should be able to upvote/downvote a question.
6. User should be able to upvote/downvote an answer.
7. User should be able to upload images while posting.
8. User should be able to view the author of a question or answer.

//NFR

1. It should be modular
2. It should have less coupling and high cohension
3. It should follow solid principle
4. It should be testable and maintain
5. User should be able to view the author of a question or answer


//Entity
1. User
2. Profile
3. Question
4. Answer
5. Vote
6. Image
7. StackOverflow




//RelationShip

1. User 1 -------- 1 Profile (Composition)

2. User 1 -------- * Question (Association)

3. User 1 -------- * Answer (Association)

4. Question 1 -------- * Answer (Composition)

5. Question 1 -------- * Image (Aggregation)

6. Answer 1 -------- * Image (Aggregation)

7. Vote * -------- 1 User (Association)

8. Vote * -------- 1 Question/Answer (Association)










